(7014152, 1060501, 43191, '<td valign="top">this is my Papillon/Jack Russel cross Maisy. She and my other dog are my best models. I have many shots of them on istock and have found them in all sorts of places, magazines, posters, adverts etc. They are so good at posing for me. All I have to say is "Do you want to do photos?" and they head for the studio. They always get paid in doggy treats after too :D Thanks everyone for the congrats. I have been a member for years but don''t enter all that often. It is a thrill to be on the front page .</td>', 'this is my Papillon/Jack Russel cross Maisy. She and my other dog are my best models. I have many shots of them on istock and have found them in all sorts of places, magazines, posters, adverts etc. They are so good at posing for me. All I have to say is "Do you want to do photos?" and they head for the studio. They always get paid in doggy treats after too :D Thanks everyone for the congrats. I have been a member for years but don''t enter all that often. It is a thrill to be on the front page .', '2013-04-05 10:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
