(7014973, 1060944, 43463, '<td valign="top">You never fail to give a different, unique, and/or interesting perspective to your work. As always, lighting and composition are very well done and thought out. I think it is very interesting that the main man with the splash of red ribbon tied around his neck is in a pose that is a nod to Christ on the sacrificial cross or a cross pose- that is a nice little detail that I wonder how many picked up. Congrats on on the blue!</td>', 'You never fail to give a different, unique, and/or interesting perspective to your work. As always, lighting and composition are very well done and thought out. I think it is very interesting that the main man with the splash of red ribbon tied around his neck is in a pose that is a nod to Christ on the sacrificial cross or a cross pose- that is a nice little detail that I wonder how many picked up. Congrats on on the blue!', '2013-04-06 23:44:24.000000', NULL, 0),
