(7052163, 1060972, 97225, '<td valign="top">I find this really funny because, although your eggs are more spectacular in their rejectability, I am reminded of a carton of a dozen eggs that we bought once. We used to get them from a friend who got them from a friend who kept chickens. Well, we must have gotten a carton of rejects by mistake. They all had something wrong with them, but not all the same thing. Some were off (very!) one was like one giant blood spot, one had a chicken in it (dead) and one was cooked! I kid you not.</td>', 'I find this really funny because, although your eggs are more spectacular in their rejectability, I am reminded of a carton of a dozen eggs that we bought once. We used to get them from a friend who got them from a friend who kept chickens. Well, we must have gotten a carton of rejects by mistake. They all had something wrong with them, but not all the same thing. Some were off (very!) one was like one giant blood spot, one had a chicken in it (dead) and one was cooked! I kid you not.', '2013-06-14 02:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
